# Hold the voice key to talk, in the demo: the aurora rises and moves with a made-up voice, a spinner while the
# answer is worked out, the answer, then it fades; a tap opens the inputs.
#   cargo run -p remote-ui -- --demo --steps scripts/voice.steps --out <dir>
awake
wait 800
snap 00-home
press v
wait 250
snap 01-entering
wait 700
snap 02-listening
wait 1800
snap 03-speaking
wait 1800
snap 04-speaking
release v
wait 400
snap 05-thinking
wait 1000
snap 06-answered
wait 5200
snap 07-gone
hold v 120
wait 1800
snap 08-tap-inputs
